{% set local_problem %}
<p>Many Elkmont homes have downspouts that simply dump water right next to the foundation. On the clay soil common throughout Limestone County, that water doesn't absorb — it pools, finds the path of least resistance, and eventually causes foundation problems.</p>

<p>Proper downspouts with adequate extensions move water well away from your home, preventing the drainage issues that lead to expensive repairs.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>A good downspout system has adequate capacity, proper positioning, and effective water dispersal. We assess your current setup and recommend improvements — whether that's adding downspouts, upgrading to larger sizes, or installing extensions that actually move water where it needs to go.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>We've been solving drainage problems throughout Limestone County for over 20 years. We understand local soil conditions and what it takes to protect foundations in this area.</p>
{% endset %}

